space_Veins smoke tests. Please ignore.

To run this simulation, execute the script `sim/space_veins_testsims/space_veins_test/runall`.

This simulation requires sumo-launchd to be started and listening for
connections on a TCP socket, e.g. using "~/lib/veins/src/veins/bin/veins_launchd -vv".

This test does checks whether vehicles can communicate via SatNic.

Setup:
- 2 vehicles (both sending UdpBasicApp packets via SatNic)

The test will fail if a vehicle can receive a packet.
It is possible that the configuration in the `omnetpp.ini` file is incorrect, which could couse the expected packet loss.

